      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. can u expand on the part about \"the privileged few\"? i want to be more specific about why their influence is actually a problem for democracy itself. like, why is wealth concentration not just an economic issue but a direct threat to our freedom? give me some strong points for that.",
